        "content": "## 1️⃣ 2️⃣ 3️⃣ Trigger + Configuration + Fetch\nRuns daily, pulls every inventory row. Required columns: row_id, item_name, current_stock, reorder_threshold, unit, supplier_name, supplier_contact, last_alert_date."
